1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,454
Marines would die for their Chapter. So why do these three wear it on ONE shoulder?

2
00:00:07,104 --> 00:00:09,191
Who are they, Sarge?

3
00:00:09,841 --> 00:00:19,501
Deathwatch. Marines lent out by their Chapters to hunt aliens for the Inquisition. Black armour. Silver left arm.

4
00:00:20,051 --> 00:00:26,921
A Space Wolf, a Templar and a Blood Angel in ONE squad? Don't they hate each other?

5
00:00:27,621 --> 00:00:29,707
Only until the xenos show up.

6
00:00:30,257 --> 00:00:33,559
Purge the alien first. Argue later.

7
00:00:34,459 --> 00:00:39,359
We argue all the way there, little man. Every time.

8
00:00:39,909 --> 00:00:42,139
And after the hunt, they go home?

9
00:00:42,789 --> 00:00:47,829
Some do. Others serve the Long Vigil until they die.

10
00:00:48,629 --> 00:00:50,298
...Then who remembers them?

11
00:00:50,848 --> 00:00:54,756
Our Chapter keeps the right shoulder. The Watch keeps the rest.

12
00:00:55,306 --> 00:01:00,507
Half a Marine goes home, kid. The other half never leaves the Vigil.

